        <Gate [
          <Criterion { checked = true } ?01M17HV8W5M2QYEZQW96P2WGZ4>
          Controller and Worker each create once, then target the exact durable instance across generation and fresh-runtime recovery with no fallback creation.
          </?01M17HV8W5M2QYEZQW96P2WGZ4>
          <Criterion { checked = true } ?01M17HV8W5M2QYEZQW96P2WGZ5>
          Focused tests, package typecheck and authority/source scans pass without adding a second graph, provider loop or Conversation store.
          </?01M17HV8W5M2QYEZQW96P2WGZ5>
